    <string name="about_us_heading">About Us</string>
    <string name="about_us_title">Serving Lavender Hill Since 2008</string>
    <string name="about_us_body">Philisa Abafazi Bethu Women Centre SA is a non-profit women and family centre founded in 2008 in Lavender Hill, Cape Town, and now based in Steenberg. We support around 100 000 people across Lavender Hill and five surrounding informal settlements through programmes rooted in hope, healing, and humanity, because every life matters.</string>
    <string name="about_us_image_desc">Volunteers and staff at the Philisa Abafazi Bethu centre</string>

